        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 473, Traditional Button Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Omnia Industries, the Traditional Button Door Knob has the kind of elegance that so many people are looking for to enhance the look of their homes while still remaining classically traditional. Made out of solid brass, this Omnia 473 traditional Button Knobset is available in polished brass, polished chrome, shaded bronze, and satin nickel finishes. Easy to install, it is designed to cover most 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled door hole. Available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions for 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Button Door Knob with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 473 Button Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-brass-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Button Door Knob",
                "description": "Made by Omnia Industries, the Traditional Button Door Knob has the kind of elegance that so many people are looking for to enhance the look of their homes while still remaining classically traditional. Made out of solid brass, this Omnia 473 traditional Button Knobset is available in polished brass, polished chrome, shaded bronze, and satin nickel finishes. Easy to install, it is designed to cover most 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled door hole. Available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions for 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Omnia 473/00 Door Knob Latchsets, OMN-473/00, Traditional door knobs, Solid brass door knobs, Traditional doorknobs, Traditional latchsets, Omnia simple door latchsets, Omnia 473 solid brass door knobs, Omnia Standard door knobs, classic knobs, traditional knobs, passage knobs, privacy knobs, traditional button knobs,"
